[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0284","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0294","title":"FreeBSD healthd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 healthd 守护进程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该进程发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，成功利用此漏洞可获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0294"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25.057","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至包含 FreeBSD-SA-00:10 安全公告补丁的版本（3.4-RELEASE 之后或 4.0-STABLE 之后），或应用 healthd 补丁修复缓冲区边界检查缺陷。如无法升级，可移除 healthd setuid 位并限制本地用户登录以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/606","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1107","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0294","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0294.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mfrr-gqjj-xm4x/GHSA-mfrr-gqjj-xm4x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfd14b52-ae78-46e8-8a1a-aa384f088125.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0246","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0276","title":"Be BeOS 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS 4.5 及 5.0 版本存在本地拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向系统发送特制的直接系统调用（使用中断 37）导致内核崩溃，造成目标系统拒绝服务。该漏洞源于操作系统对系统调用参数校验不严，攻击者无需特殊权限即可触发，影响 BeOS 4.5 和 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0276"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.743","remediation":"BeOS 已停止维护且原厂商已倒闭，官方不再提供安全更新。如必须运行 BeOS 环境，建议限制本地用户登录权限、禁用不必要的外部系统调用接口，并将系统部署于隔离网络环境中。最佳缓解方案是迁移至受支持的现代操作系统（如 FreeBSD、Linux）运行 BeOS 兼容层。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1098","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000410131628.659.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19840","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0276.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0276","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0276.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0276.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wwrg-82fc-4xc8/GHSA-wwrg-82fc-4xc8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0276.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eebf829d86861484c6ea731ef53f87c686c4f91c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0244","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0275","title":"CRYPTOCard CRYPTOAdmin for PalmOS 弱加密漏洞","description":"CRYPTOCard CRYPTOAdmin for PalmOS 使用弱加密算法存储用户的 PIN 码，攻击者在获取 Palm 设备的 .PDB 数据文件后，可通过暴力破解或逆向分析手段还原 PIN 码，进而生成有效的 PT-1 双因素认证令牌。该漏洞影响 CRYPTOCard CRYPTOAdmin 4.1 版本，利用前提是攻击者能够访问物理设备上的 .PDB 文件，属于本地信息泄露漏洞，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0275"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.627","remediation":"该漏洞源于 CRYPTOCard CryptoAdmin 4.1 for PalmOS 使用弱加密算法存储用户 PIN，攻击者可读取 .PDB 文件后破解 PIN 生成有效 PT-1 令牌。由于该产品已停止维护，建议立即停止使用 CRYPTOCard CryptoAdmin 4.1，迁移至支持强加密（如 AES-256）的双因素认证解决方案；同时确保 PalmOS 设备上的 .PDB 文件通过文件系统权限限制访问，并对存储敏感数据的文件实施全盘加密。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0033.html","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/cc-pinextract.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1097","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19839","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0275.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0275","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0275.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0275.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j3qx-3h5c-5hvp/GHSA-j3qx-3h5c-5hvp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0275.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1097/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0242","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0274","title":"Bray Systems Linux Trustees 1.5 长路径名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Trustees 内核补丁 1.5 版本中存在路径名处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过访问包含超长路径名的文件或目录，触发内核在处理路径时发生异常，导致拒绝服务（系统崩溃或服务不可用）。该漏洞影响部署了 Bray Systems Linux Trustees 1.5 内核补丁的 Linux 系统，需本地用户权限触发，无法远程利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0274"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.503","remediation":"升级 Linux Trustees 至 1.6 或更高版本，该版本已在路径名处理中增加了长度边界校验。由于该项目已停止维护且厂商网站已失效，建议迁移至现代文件系统访问控制方案，如使用 Linux 原生 LSM（SELinux/AppArmor）替代 Trustees 内核补丁，可从根本上消除此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0035.html","http://www.braysystems.com/linux/trustees.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1096","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19837","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e