ed":"2000-04-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.387","remediation":"建议升级至 Symantec pcAnywhere 12.5 或更高版本，旧版 8.0/9.0 已不受支持且存在多个已知漏洞。如无法升级，应在防火墙层面限制 TCP 5631 和 UDP 5632 端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的远程控制功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0031.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1095","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0273.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0273","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0273.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0273.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g592-cwxj-fv67/GHSA-g592-cwxj-fv67.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0273.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001271.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1ae26e59-e1a5-4031-89c1-e2ee8c0f2ca6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0289","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0298","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 无人值守安装权限配置漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 在使用 OEMPreinstall 选项进行无人值守预安装时，会为 All Users 和 Default Users 目录设置不安全的默认权限，导致本地攻击者可利用该权限配置缺陷访问或修改其他用户的文件和数据。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具有本地访问权限方可利用，建议安装安全更新或手动修正目录权限配置。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0298"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25.530","remediation":"安装 Windows 2000 无人值守安装完成后，应立即手动修复 All Users 和 Default Users 目录的 ACL 权限，限制非授权用户的写入访问。建议使用安全模板 (Security Templates) 强制应用最小权限策略，或升级至受支持的操作系统版本。如无法升级，可在安装后运行 `secedit /configure /cfg sec_template.inf` 重新应用安全配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1758","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4278","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0298.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0298.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0298","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0298.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0298.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m839-2cw4-994j/GHSA-m839-2cw4-994j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0298.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001270.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8339933e-ec5f-4cd5-818f-d96cfe56d808.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0298.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0289.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0249","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0279","title":"Be BeOS IP报文长度字段处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Be BeOS 4.0/4.5/5.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 IP 数据包触发该漏洞，其中数据包长度字段值小于实际头部长度，导致系统无法正确处理而崩溃。该漏洞影响 BeOS 4.0、4.5 及 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前官方已停止支持，建议用户迁移至其他操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0279"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23.117","remediation":"BeOS 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议在网络边界防火墙启用非法分片包过滤规则，丢弃 IP 首部长度字段与载荷长度不一致的异常数据包。同时在受影响的 BeOS 主机上禁用不必要的网络服务，并限制仅允许受信任内网段访问。长远建议迁移至仍受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0029.html","http://bebugs.be.com/devbugs/detail.php3?oid=2505312","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1100","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19841","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0279","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0279.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rf4g-4vxr-q8px/GHSA-rf4g-4vxr-q8px.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--712755d6-06ba-4e6a-ad3a-52dd3b3274dd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0260","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0300","title":"Symantec pcAnywhere 弱加密漏洞","description":"Symantec pcAnywhere 9.x 默认使用弱加密算法对网络通信进行加密，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过嗅探网络流量捕获加密数据包，并利用弱加密的缺陷解密数据包内容，从而窃取 pcAnywhere 或 NT 域账户的明文凭据。该漏洞影响 pcAnywhere 9.0 及 9.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者获取凭据后可进一步控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0300"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25.770","remediation":"升级到 Symantec pcAnywhere 12.5 或更高版本，启用强制 256 位 AES 加密。如无法升级，在连接设置中禁用默认弱加密并启用 SSL 加密。同时在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信 IP 访问 5631/TCP 和 5632/UDP 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1093","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000406030958.23902.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19836","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0300","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0300.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvrm-4gj8-jr73/GHSA-fvrm-4gj8-jr73.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0292","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0301","title":"Ipswitch IMail AUTH CRAM-MD5 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 服务器 6.02 及更早版本在处理 AUTH CRAM-MD5 认证命令时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 143 端口发送特制的 AUTH CRAM-MD5 请求，由于服务器对挑战响应的 CRLF 结束符处理不当，导致服务进程锁定并停止响应，正常用户无法访问邮件服务。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低且无需任何权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0301"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-06","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.03 或更高版本，该版本已修复 CRAM-MD5 认证处理中缺少 CRLF 结束符导致的锁定问题。如无法立即升级，可在服务器上禁用 CRAM-MD5 认证方式，强制客户端使用 LOGIN 认证；同时在 Eudora 客户端中设置 SmtpAuthBanished=CRAM-MD5 以绕过该认证方法。若服务已锁定，需重启 IMail 服务进程恢复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95505800117143&w=2","http://support.ipswitch.com/kb/IM-20000208-DM02.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1094"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0227","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0251","title":"HP-UX VirtualVault 多别名 IP 接口信息泄露漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.04 VirtualVault (VVOS) 存在信息泄露漏洞。当网络接口配置了多个别名 IP 地址时，系统会将本应发送给受信任虚拟服务器的数据错误地路由至非特权进程，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，但需要目标系统存在特定网络配置环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0251"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-06","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"建议立即安装 HP 针对 VirtualVault VVOS 发布的安全补丁（HP Security Bulletin HPSBUX0004-112），升级至修复后的 HP-UX 11.04 VVOS 版本。如无法立即修补，应避免在 VirtualVault 接口上配置多个别名 IP 地址，并将非必要的未授权进程从该网络接口上移除，以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0021.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1090"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0230","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0230.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0255","title":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器中存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送针对 FormMail CGI 程序的扫描探测请求，触发设备处理异常，导致路由器服务崩溃或无法正常响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 系列路由器，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0255"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"2000-04-05","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器已停产且厂商已被收购，不再提供官方固件更新。建议用户：1）禁用路由器 Web 管理界面中不必要的 CGI 功能模块；2）配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许可信 IP 地址访问管理端口；3）使用防火墙规则拦截对 FormMail CGI 路径的外部扫描请求；4）将设备替换为仍在厂商支持周期内的新一代路由器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0022.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1091"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0230.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0259","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0299","title":"Apple WebObjects Developer 4.5 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple WebObjects Developer 4.5 中的 WebObjects.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 HTTP 头（如 Accept 字段）的恶意请求触发该漏洞，导致 WebObjects 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响安装于 Windows NT 4.0 + IIS 4.0 平台上的 WebObjects Developer 4.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0299"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25.650","remediation":"升级 Apple WebObjects 至 4.5 以上安全版本，或迁移至受支持的 WebObjects 5.x 版本。如无法升级，在 IIS 中限制 HTTP 请求头长度，或禁用 WebObjects CGI 适配器以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0020.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20379","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0299","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0299.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fqg-f27x-w5jj/GHSA-6fqg-f27x-w5jj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001264.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0259.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0259.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0485","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0485.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0634","title":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro 3.2.5 及更早版本的 Web 管理界面存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过在 URL 中注入 `../` 序列实现目录跳转，从而读取服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞允许攻击者获取系统关键数据，为进一步渗透提供基础。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0634"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-04-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09.323","remediation":"升级 CommuniGate Pro 至 3.2.5 之后的修复版本（官方已在 2000 年 7 月发布补丁）；同时将 Web 管理接口绑定到内网地址，在防火墙层面限制管理端口（默认 8010 端口）仅允许受信管理 IP 访问；使用反向代理对请求路径进行 `../` 过滤，防止路径穿越攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0223.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5774","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1493","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5105","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20091","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0634.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0634","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6